WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.579
Open a task and choose Add link in its details.

2
00:00:02.579 --> 00:00:05.091
Choose Chapter, then choose The light goes out.

3
00:00:05.091 --> 00:00:08.044
